'''Shadows over Doge Kingdom''' (わんわん王国の異変, ''Wan Wan Ōkoku no Ihen'', '''Anomaly in the Wan Wan Kingdom''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that was added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]] for the [[Anniversary/11 1/2 Year|11 and 1/2 Anniversary]] ([[Anniversary/11th Year|11th Anniversary]] internationally).

==Overview==
===About===
The Shadows over Doge Kingdom Gauntlet contains a total of 10 stages. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

